# Wick, the Whorled Mind: "{U}{B}{R}, Sacrifice a Snail: Wick deals damage equal to the sacrificed creature's power to each opponent.
# Then draw cards equal to the sacrificed creature's power." Wick's Snail token is given -1/-0 twice by two Fleeting Distractions
# (a -1/1) and then sacrificed: its power as it last was is below 0, so Bot2 takes no damage and Bot1 draws no cards (CR 107.1b,
# 120.8, 121.1). Bot1's hand is the two cards the Distractions drew.

